  "bookId": "JER",
  "reference": "Yeremia 44",
  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "44",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JER 44"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "44",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu lilimjia Yeremia kuhusu Wayahudi waliokuwa wanakaa nchini Misri katika miji ya Migdoli, Tahpanesi, Memfisi na sehemu ya Pathrosi: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi, Mungu wa Israeli asema hivi: Nyinyi mmeona maafa yote niliyouletea mji wa Yerusalemu na miji yote ya Yuda. Miji hii ni magofu mpaka leo wala hakuna mtu aishiye humo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imekuwa hivyo kwa sababu ya uovu walioufanya, wakanikasirisha kwa kuifukizia ubani na kuitumikia miungu mingine ambayo wao wenyewe hawakuifahamu, wala nyinyi, wala wazee wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo, mimi daima niliwatuma kwenu watumishi wangu manabii nikisema: Msifanye jambo hili baya ninalolichukia! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini hakuna aliyenisikiliza wala kunitegea sikio. Nyinyi mlikataa kuacha uovu wenu na kuacha kuifukizia ubani miungu mingine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo, ghadhabu yangu na hasira yangu iliwaka na kumiminika juu ya miji ya Yuda na barabara za Yerusalemu, hata kukawa jangwa na magofu kama ilivyo mpaka leo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sasa, mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi, Mungu wa Israeli, nauliza hivi: Mbona mnajiletea madhara makubwa namna hii, na kujiangamiza nyinyi wenyewe, wanaume kwa wanawake, watoto wadogo na wachanga, hata pasibaki mtu katika Yuda? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa nini mnanichochea nikasirike kwa kuabudu sanamu mlizojitengenezea wenyewe na kuifukizia ubani miungu mingine katika nchi ya Misri ambamo mmekuja kuishi? Je, mwataka kutokomezwa na kuwa laana na dhihaka mbele ya mataifa yote duniani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Je, mmesahau uovu wa wazee wenu, uovu wa wafalme wa Yuda, uovu wa wake zao na uovu wenu nyinyi wenyewe na wa wake zenu, ambao mliufanya nchini Yuda na kwenye barabara za Yerusalemu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpaka hivi leo hamjajinyenyekesha wala kuogopa wala kuzifuata sheria zangu na kanuni zangu nilizowawekea nyinyi na wazee wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwa hiyo, mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi, Mungu wa Israeli, nasema hivi: Haya! Nitawageukia niwaleteeni maafa na kuiangamiza Yuda yote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitawaondoa watu wa Yuda waliosalia ambao wamepania kwenda kukaa Misri, na kuwaangamiza wote, wakubwa kwa wadogo; watakufa kwa upanga au kwa njaa. Watakuwa takataka, kitisho, laana na dhihaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitawaadhibu wale wanaokaa katika nchi ya Misri kama nilivyouadhibu mji wa Yerusalemu, kwa vita, njaa, na maradhi mabaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa hiyo hapatakuwa na mtu hata mmoja kati ya watu wa Yuda waliosalia na kwenda kukaa katika nchi ya Misri ambaye atanusurika au kuishi au kurudi katika nchi ya Yuda ambayo wanatamani kurudi na kuishi humo. Hawatarudi, isipokuwa baadhi ya wakimbizi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, wanaume wote waliojua kwamba wake zao walikuwa wameifukizia ubani miungu mingine, na wanawake wote waliokuwa hapo, kusanyiko kubwa la watu, pamoja na Waisraeli waliokuwa wanakaa Pathrosi katika nchi ya Misri walimjibu Yeremia: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Jambo hilo ulilotuambia kwa niaba ya Mwenyezi-Mungu hatutalitii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini kila kitu tulichoapa kufanya tutafanya: Tutamfukizia ubani malkia wa mbinguni na kummiminia tambiko ya kinywaji kama tulivyokuwa tunafanya sisi wenyewe na wazee wetu, wafalme wetu na viongozi wetu, katika miji ya Yuda na katika barabara za Yerusalemu. Ama wakati huo tulikuwa na chakula tele, tulistawi na hatukuona janga lolote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini tangu tuache kumfukizia ubani malkia wa mbinguni na kummiminia kinywaji, tumetindikiwa kila kitu, na tumeangamizwa kwa vita na njaa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao wanawake wakasema, “Tulimfukizia ubani na kummiminia kinywaji malkia wa mbinguni. Tulifanya hivyo kwa kibali cha waume zetu. Tena tulimtengenezea mikate yenye sura yake na kummiminia kinywaji!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Yeremia akawaambia watu wote, wanaume kwa wanawake, yaani watu wote waliompa jibu hilo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kuhusu matambiko ambayo nyinyi na wazee wenu, wafalme wenu na viongozi wenu, pamoja na wananchi wote, mlifanya katika miji ya Yuda na katika barabara za Yerusalemu, je, mnadhani Mwenyezi-Mungu amesahau au hakumbuki? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu hakuweza kuvumilia tena matendo yenu maovu na mambo ya kuchukiza mliyotenda; ndiyo maana nchi yenu imekuwa ukiwa, jangwa, laana na bila wakazi, kama ilivyo mpaka leo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maafa haya yamewapata mpaka leo kwa sababu mliitolea sadaka za kuteketezwa miungu mingine na kumkosea Mwenyezi-Mungu, mkakataa kutii sauti yake au kufuata sheria yake, kanuni zake na maagizo yake.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeremia aliwaambia watu wote na wanawake wote: “Sikilizeni neno la Mwenyezi-Mungu, enyi watu wa Yuda wote mlioko nchini Misri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi-Mungu wa majeshi, Mungu wa Israeli, asema hivi: Nyinyi pamoja na wake zenu mmetekeleza kwa vitendo yale mliyotamka kwa vinywa vyenu, mkisema kwamba mmepania kutimiza viapo vyenu mlivyofanya vya kumtolea sadaka na kummiminia kinywaji malkia wa mbinguni. Haya basi! Shikeni viapo vyenu na kutoa sadaka za vinywaji! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini sikilizeni neno langu mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu, enyi watu wote wa Yuda mnaokaa nchini Misri. Mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu nasema hivi: Naapa kwa jina langu kuu kwamba hakuna mtu yeyote wa Yuda katika nchi yote ya Misri atakayelitumia jina langu kuapa nalo akisema: ‘Kama aishivyo Bwana Mwenyezi-Mungu!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi nawachungulia hao sio kwa mema bali kwa mabaya. Watu wote wa Yuda nchini Misri wataangamizwa kwa upanga na njaa, asibaki hata mtu mmoja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni wachache watakaonusurika vitani na kurudi kutoka nchi ya Misri na kwenda nchini Yuda. Hapo watu wa Yuda wote waliobaki kati ya wale waliokwenda kukaa Misri watatambua ni tamko la nani lenye nguvu: Langu au lao! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu nasema kwamba nitawaadhibu hapahapa mpate kujua kwamba maneno ya maafa niliyotamka dhidi yenu yatatimia. Na hii itakuwa ishara yake: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 44:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nitamtia Farao Hofra mfalme wa Misri, mikononi mwa madui zake, mikononi mwa wale wanaotaka kumwua, kama vile nilivyomtia Sedekia mfalme wa Yuda, mikononi mwa adui yake yaani Nebukadneza, mfalme wa Babuloni, ambaye alitaka kumwua. Mimi Mwenyezi-Mungu nimesema.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.44.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.44.30"
            ]
          }
        }
